		{
			description: [
				"Productive Bees is a breeding and resource system, not merely a prettier vanilla hive. Use JEI to trace a desired bee backward through its parents, nest requirements and flower preferences."
				"Label breeding enclosures and keep spare parents. Rebuilding a lost lineage from memory is far harder than keeping one safe pair."
				"Treat rare bees like breeding stock rather than disposable machines. Their value is the lineage they unlock."
				"The Apiarists' Oath values continuity over maximum output. Maintain spare breeding stock, protect rare lineages from accidental release, and teach one other player how to recover the apiary if its builder is absent."
			]
			id: "6DB0620C467D51A3"
