		{
			dependencies: ["2496EF07B0024685"]
			description: [
				"Find the resource bee you want in JEI, open its breeding recipe and trace each parent backward until you reach species you already own or can find."
				"Write the chain on signs near the Breeding Chamber and prepare all flowering items first. Incubate or mature offspring before assuming the recipe failed."
				"Breed a spare at each important branch. A lineage archive turns future bee projects from repeated exploration into planned husbandry."
				"Breeding recipes specify parents and often a flowering block. Use JEI's bee categories, isolate the pair, confirm both are adults and able to breed, and record the successful lineage for the community apiary."
			]
			id: "3660C09F3A4CA58C"
			rewards: [{
				id: "4E6FBE11B8CD671A"
				type: "xp"
