		{
			dependencies: ["1E6B88446082562E"]
			description: [
				"Bee material can be collected through the bottler method or slowly through gene-sampling upgrades. The Centrifuge separates bottled material into genes such as productivity, tolerance, behaviour and type."
				"Combine partial samples until they are useful, apply a gene to a Honey Treat, then feed the treat to the target bee. Keep a named breeding pair with desirable traits as the genetic foundation."
				"Automate only after the manual loop works. Genetics is powerful because it removes bad luck from husbandry; it should not turn living bees into an unexplained disposal pipeline."
			]
